  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p style=\"margin-top:0px;color:rgb(17,17,17);font-family:'Libre Bodoni', serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.2px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">I started this brand because I was tired of babying my jewelry. I love beautiful things. The kind that makes you feel sexy, confident, and elevated, but I’m hard on my pieces. I’d spend real money, then feel crushed if I lost them (ADHD girly). So I created a brand that could handle real life: jewelry that’s luxe, durable, and still feels like a treat.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(17,17,17);font-family:'Libre Bodoni', serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.2px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">Everything you see here is crafted from 18K PVD gold, tarnish-free and waterproof, that sweet spot between looking like a million bucks and not freaking out if it goes missing. These pieces are made to live in. To layer. To turn heads. To feel like you.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(17,17,17);font-family:'Libre Bodoni', serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.2px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">I believe jewelry should be wearable magic, not something you have to overthink. My designs are meant to make you feel like <em>you,</em> just turned up a little. Sexy. Cool. Effortless.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(17,17,17);font-family:'Libre Bodoni', serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.2px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">Not about trends. It’s about creating a <em>feel</em> that lasts. Jewelry you’ll keep reaching for. Pieces you actually want to wear.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(17,17,17);font-family:'Libre Bodoni', serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.2px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">So go ahead, indulge. Mix, match, stack, lose one at the beach, and still sleep at night. This is guilt-free, gold-drenched luxury. Made with love, for women who know exactly who they are.             </p></div>",
